Set end_date (and optional end_date_confidence / end_date_prose) on an
existing State or Event node. Use when a residence / job / membership
era ended.

Refuses on non-State/Event node_types, or on a node that already has
an end_date — pass force=true to overwrite (the prior value is captured
in kg_revision_log so reverse is possible).

Always pass a non-empty `reason`. Pass `dry_run: true` to preview.
